# Copy to db/loans_api_demo.env (git-ignored) and fill in.
#
# Postgres connection string of the Supabase project standing in for the loan origination system
# (scripts/seed_loans_api.py, specs/screen-data-ingestion.md section 3d). NOT the app's own database.
# In Supabase: Connect -> Session pooler (works over IPv4; the "Direct connection" host is IPv6-only on
# the free plan) -> copy the URI and put the database password in it.
#
# Format: postgresql://postgres.<project-ref>:PASSWORD@aws-0-<region>.pooler.supabase.com:5432/postgres
SUPABASE_DB_URL=
